cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usar estes resultados, cite este repositório. If you use these results, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "cnpj-brasil: comparação medida de APIs gratuitas de consulta CNPJ (Measured comparison of free Brazilian CNPJ lookup APIs)"
abstract: >-
  Exploratory measurement of seven free Brazilian CNPJ lookup APIs (BrasilAPI, Minha Receita,
  ReceitaWS, CNPJá Open, CNPJ.ws, OpenCNPJ.org and OpenCNPJ.com) with the same CNPJs on
  2026-11-16/17 UTC: coverage, field completeness, validity, cross-API agreement, freshness,
  alphanumeric CNPJ support, rate limits and latency. Includes the collection code, the aggregated
  results and a suggestion by use case.
authors:
